1. `runAsNonRoot: true` (Pod or container)
2. `seccompProfile: {type: "RuntimeDefault"}` (Pod or container)
3. `capabilities: {drop: ["ALL"]}` (Pod or container)
4. `allowPrivilegeEscalation: false` (Container)

I will patch the deployment using a strategic merge patch to add these fields to both the Pod-level and the Container-level `securityContext` to ensure compliance.

Patch payload structure:
```json
{
  "spec": {
    "template": {
      "spec": {
        "securityContext": {
          "runAsNonRoot": true,
          "seccompProfile": {
            "type": "RuntimeDefault"
          },
          "capabilities": {
            "drop": ["ALL"]
          }
        },
        "containers": [
          {
            "name": "app",
            "securityContext": {
              "allowPrivilegeEscalation": false
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```
