  {
    "name":"app",
    "securityContext": {
      "allowPrivilegeEscalation": false,
      "capabilities": {"drop": ["ALL"]},
      "runAsUser": 65532
    }
  }
]
```
The warning `Warning: unknown field "spec.template.spec.containers[0].securityContext.capabilities.runAsUser"` suggests that K8s is trying to parse the field `runAsUser` *inside* the `capabilities` object, which is incorrect based on the YAML structure I provided in the JSON patch.

